# =============================================================================
# DEFAULT-DENY. Everything is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
#
# This repo (arielsacerdoti/suono-e-silenzio) is PUBLIC and its root is the
# entire user profile, so every file on the machine sits inside its working
# tree. A denylist cannot be trusted here — it only protects what someone
# remembered to list, and the cost of forgetting one line is publishing it.
#
# Written 2026-08-03 after finding the Autom8Labs Business Dashboard (115
# customer names, 124 deal values) untracked and unprotected, alongside
# github_pat.txt, live Schwab OAuth tokens and an Android private key. None had
# ever been committed — confirmed against full history — but all were one
# `git add -A` away from it.
#
# To track something new, add an explicit `!` line for it. That extra step is
# the point: publishing becomes deliberate rather than accidental.
# =============================================================================

# Ignore everything at the root.
/*

# ── The suono-e-silenzio website — what this repo is actually for ────────────
!/.gitignore
!/about.html
!/contact.html
!/dana.html
!/index.html
!/resources.html
!/sessions.html
!/css/
!/data/
!/images/
!/js/
!/lang/

# ── AlphaPicks dashboard: the three source files, and nothing else ───────────
# Descend into OneDrive/Schwab without letting anything else through. Each level
# must be re-ignored, because Git will not look inside a directory it has
# already excluded.
!/OneDrive/
/OneDrive/*
!/OneDrive/Schwab/
/OneDrive/Schwab/*
!/OneDrive/Schwab/AlphaPicks Mobile.html
!/OneDrive/Schwab/AlphaPicks Portfolio.html
!/OneDrive/Schwab/schwab_server.ps1

# Deliberately NOT allowed through, and each for a reason:
#   schwab_tokens.json / schwab_config.json  live brokerage OAuth credentials
#   github_pat.txt                           a GitHub personal access token
#   store.json / mobile_data*.json           positions and balances
#   *.xlsx / *.csv / *.log                   holdings, transactions, history
#   Startup Investments/                     Autom8Labs client list and pipeline
#
# Autom8Labs/Business Dashboard is its OWN private git repo (initialised
# 2026-08-03), shared with Ori and Amir. It must never be absorbed into this one:
# this repo is PUBLIC, and it also carries the AlphaPicks brokerage files, which
# are personal financial data that must not travel alongside a partner-shared
# business project. The default-deny rule at the top already excludes it; this
# note records why that must stay true.
